The Lilpa Boxing Tournament (リルパボクシング大会) ran on {{Date|2025-11-22}} and {{Date|2025-11-23}}. VTuber Lilpa (リルパ) of the Korean VTuber group 異世界アイドル hosted. Eight teams of three drafted members each. Teams had a five-day practice period. Official collab glove skins went on sale for the teams.<ref name="lilpa">[https://vrcboxing.com/2026/02/06/%e8%b3%9e%e9%87%91100%e4%b8%87%e5%86%86%e8%a6%8f%e6%a8%a1-%e7%b7%8f%e8%a6%96%e8%81%b4%e8%80%85%e6%95%b08%e4%b8%87%e4%ba%ba-%e9%9f%93%e5%9b%bd%e3%81%aevtuber%e4%b8%bb%e5%82%ac%e3%81%ae%e5%a4%a7/ 賞金100万円規模 総視聴者数8万人 韓国のVTuber主催の大会「リルパボクシング大会」開催] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2026-02-06}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-12}}.</ref>

The Vket2025Winter special tournament (Vket2025Winter特別大会) ran on {{Date|2025-12-13}} with 120 applicants. Departments were Casual (カジュアル), [[File:VRC_BOXING_icon_-_3-point.png|24px|alt=3-point]] 3-point Standard (3点スタンダード), and competition rule (競技ルール).<ref name="vket2025">[https://vrcboxing.com/2026/02/06/%e5%bf%9c%e5%8b%9f%e7%b7%8f%e6%95%b0120%e5%90%8d%e3%80%80%e3%80%8cvrcboxing-vket2025winter%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%9a%e3%80%8d%e9%96%8b%e5%82%ac/ 応募総数120名　「VRCBOXING Vket2025Winter特別大会」開催] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2026-02-06}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-12}}.</ref>

VRC BOXING SUMMER SHOWDOWN had three departments: [[File:VRC_BOXING_icon_-_3-point.png|24px|alt=3-point]] 3-point tracking, competition rule (競技ルール), and [[File:VRC_BOXING_icon_-_FBT.png|24px|alt=FBT]] FBT. Competition rule is full tracking only. Qualifiers ran on {{Date|2026-08-29}} and {{Date|2026-08-30}} at {{Time|20:30}} Japan time, as 2-minute, 2-round matches. The final ran on {{Date|2026-09-12}} as a YouTube LIVE from {{Time|20:00}} Japan time.<ref name="showdown">[https://vrcboxing.com/2026/08/04/vrc-boxing-summer-showdown%e3%80%80%e5%87%ba%e5%a0%b4%e9%81%b8%e6%89%8b%e5%8b%9f%e9%9b%86%e9%96%8b%e5%a7%8b/ VRC BOXING SUMMER SHOWDOWN　出場選手募集開始] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2026-08-04}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref><ref name="showdown-live">[https://vrcboxing.com/2026/09/11/%e3%80%909-12-live%e9%85%8d%e4%bf%a1%e3%80%91%e3%80%8cvrc-boxing-summer-showdown%e3%80%8d%e9%96%8b%e5%82%ac/ 【9/12 LIVE配信】「VRC BOXING SUMMER SHOWDOWN」開催] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2026-09-11}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref><ref name="showdown-yt">[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dEqU12-vAMw 【 VRC BOXING 】SUMMER SHOWDOWN【 #VRChat 】] on ''YouTube''. Retrieved {{Date|2026-09-12}}.</ref> Department winners were Mio (FBT), taiyoukeee (competition rule), and 森永 (3-point tracking).<ref name="showdown-x">[https://twitter.com/VrcBoxing/status/2098811456158622136 @VrcBoxing] on ''X''. Retrieved {{Date|2026-09-12}}.</ref>

Official tournaments use a regulation document for illegal punches and tracking abuse.<ref name="reg">[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vVzjNbPeCYSAmMlxIhA3wa8r9UyxU_71ZDYS05ZTRfk/edit VRCBOXING 大会レギュレーション]. Retrieved {{Date|2026-09-12}}.</ref>

VRC BOXING holds player practice (選手向け) on Wednesdays and a social meet (交流会) on Sundays, both from {{Time|21:00}}.<ref name="tsushin3-yt">[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PErvvr4qqe0 【VRCボクシング通信】第3回　初心者必見！パンチの打ち方はこれだ！【VRChat】] video description on ''YouTube''. Retrieved {{Date|2026-09-12}}.</ref>

== History ==

[[File:VRC_BOXING_World_History.png|center|1000px|alt=VRC BOXING World History]]

The gym mural is titled VRC BOXING World History.

Production started on {{Date|2022-06-11}} after VRCボクシング練習会 (VRC Boxing practice group) recruited a gimmick maker to replace the older Udon Boxing world used for practice and cups.<ref name="wantedly">[https://www.wantedly.com/users/163384756/post_articles/427441 2か月でVRボクシングゲームを製作してVketで大会を開いた話（大会本番編）] on ''wantedly.com''. Dated {{Date|2022-08-31}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref>

Practice moved onto this world, then titled VRC BOXING GYM JP, by {{Date|2022-07-26}}.<ref name="gizmodo">[https://www.gizmodo.jp/article/vrc-boxing/ 部活のような雰囲気だけど先輩後輩の垣根はない。「VRCボクシング練習会」で味わえる“対人スポーツの楽しさ”] on ''gizmodo.jp''. Dated {{Date|2022-07-26}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref>

In July 2022 the world opened with eSports Mode.

The VRCボクシング大会 Vket2022Summer杯 ran on {{Date|2022-08-21}} at {{Time|21:00}}.<ref name="gs-vket">[https://www.gamespark.jp/article/2022/08/20/121444.html 迫力！新しいVRボクシングをYouTubeで観戦「VRCボクシング大会 Vket2022Summer杯」8/21開催] on ''gamespark.jp''. Dated {{Date|2022-08-20}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref>

In December 2022 SEASON FINAL GRAND SLAM ran in Vket 2022 Winter.

In January 2023 Real Mode shipped. It was later renamed Standard Mode.

In March 2023 the VRCボクシング大会 トリオ杯 ran.

In July 2023 SPARK LINK ran. The VRCボクシング大会 in Vket 2023 Summer ran the same month.

In December 2023 SEASON FINAL GRAND SLAM ran in Vket 2023 Winter.

WOW Sports Entertainment Inc. was founded on {{Date|2023-11-30}}.<ref name="about" /> On {{Date|2024-02-19}} VRC Boxing appeared at the JBC (Japan Boxing Commission) 2023 awards, and WOW Sports partnered with VRChat.<ref name="jbc">[https://vrcboxing.com/2024/02/19/jbc_join/ ボクシング界の最高峰、JBC『2023年度年間優秀選手表彰式』にメタバース上のボクシング団体『VRCボクシング』が参加] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2024-02-19}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref><ref name="gs-jbc">[https://www.gamespark.jp/article/2024/02/19/138569.html 夢のメタバース・ボクシングへ！日本ボクシングコミッションが「VRCボクシング」をお披露目] on ''gamespark.jp''. Dated {{Date|2024-02-19}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref>

Weekly practice ran Thursday and Sunday from {{Time|21:00}} to {{Time|23:00}} by {{Date|2024-02-20}}.<ref name="intro" />

In March 2024 Casual Mode shipped.

The world added an in-world shop, a VIP ROOM, and a redesigned entrance and practice floor on {{Date|2024-04-06}}.<ref name="shop">[https://vrcboxing.com/2024/04/19/60万visit記念、vrcボクシング販売ブースをopen/ 60万visit記念、VRCボクシング販売ブースをOPEN] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2024-04-19}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref>

In May 2024 World Renewal shipped. The VRCボクシング大会 新人杯 ran the same month.

VRC BOXING reached 1 million visits on {{Date|2024-06-06}} and 2 million visits on {{Date|2024-08-05}}.<ref name="1m">[https://vrcboxing.com/2024/06/06/vrc%e3%83%9c%e3%82%af%e3%82%b7%e3%83%b3%e3%82%b0%e7%b7%8fvisit%e6%95%b0100%e4%b8%87%e4%ba%ba%e9%81%94%e6%88%90%ef%bc%81/ VRCボクシング総visit数100万人達成！] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2024-06-06}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-12}}.</ref><ref name="2m">[https://vrcboxing.com/2024/08/05/%e7%b7%8fvisit%e6%95%b0200%e4%b8%87%e4%ba%ba%e9%81%94%e6%88%90%ef%bc%81/ 総visit数200万人達成！] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2024-08-05}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-12}}.</ref>

In July 2024 VRC BOXING COMMUNITY CUP ran.

In December 2024 VIRTUAL KNOCKOUT Vket SPECIAL MATCH ran.

In February 2025 CASIO presents VRC BOXING G-SHOCK CUP ran.

On {{Date|2026-02-06}} the world passed 10 million visits. Free commemorative glove skins in black, red, and blue marked that milestone.<ref name="10m">[https://vrcboxing.com/2026/02/06/%e3%80%8cvrc-boxing%e3%80%8d%e3%83%af%e3%83%bc%e3%83%ab%e3%83%89%e8%a8%aa%e5%95%8f%e5%9b%9e%e6%95%b01000%e4%b8%87%e5%9b%9e%e7%aa%81%e7%a0%b4/ 「VRC BOXING」ワールド訪問回数1,000万回突破!!] on ''vrcboxing.com''. Dated {{Date|2026-02-06}}; retrieved {{Date|2026-09-11}}.</ref>

In May 2025 PICO MOTION IMPACT VRC BOXING SPECIAL ran.

In July 2025 Vket 2025 Summer 特別大会 ran.

In November 2025 USA Mode shipped.

In December 2025 Vket 2025 Winter 特別大会 ran. FBT Mode shipped the same month.

